# gate/boot.script — hidden scripted boot to character select (patch 0020, PS2X_INPUT_SCRIPT).
# Run: bash tools/ob.sh boot --script gate/boot.script --tag <T>; dumps <screen>-<k>.png in C:\ob\frames-<T>.
# Guest-state predicates only (no game data). Addresses: SLPM_654.28 en; sources R1.1-007, R1.1-008,
# phase-ends/current/tasks/T4.md (boot-task slot from splat asm; values confirmed by the t4disc watch boot).
#   0x002F85D8 u16 = boot task (task pool D_002F85D0 slot 0): byte0 step, byte1 sub (boottask.c:80-170)
#   *0x0023BE34    = TitleWork*: +0 state, +1 sub, +2 step, +3 unk (title.c:9-49)
#   *0x003065FC    = SelectWork*: +4 state, 8 = Scenario Select, 9 = character select (title.c:1150-1160, :1455-1480)
# Settle waits (wait vsync) put each capture inside the screen's fully faded-in span.
timeout 420

log save-data screen (memory-card prompt): boot task step 1 sub 4
wait mem 0x002F85D8 2 == 0x0401
wait vsync 120
capture savedata 3
press left 8
wait vsync 30
press circle 8

log ACCESS logo: boot task step 1 sub 9 (128 vsyncs)
wait mem 0x002F85D8 2 == 0x0901
wait vsync 100
capture access 3

log CAPCOM logo: title state 0 sub 0 step 1
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00010000
wait vsync 120
capture capcom 3

log title PRESS START: title state 0 sub 2 step 3
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00030200
wait vsync 120
capture title 3
press start 8

log main menu input wait: title state 1 sub 5 step 5
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00050501
wait vsync 60
capture mainmenu 3
press circle 8

log single-play entry screen: title state 2 sub 2 step 2
wait mem *0x0023BE34+0 4 == 0x00020202
wait vsync 60
press circle 8

log Scenario Select: select state 8 (t4dbg boot)
wait mem *0x003065FC+4 1 == 8
wait vsync 120
press circle 8

log character select: select state 9 (10/11 = Difficulty)
wait mem *0x003065FC+4 1 == 9
wait vsync 90
capture charselect 3
quit
